# Cursor / Copilot / AI Assistant shared hints (root rules)

- Keep answers concise.
- Match existing code style.
- Flake8 line length limit: <= 100 characters on all files.

## Telegram HTML Formatting Rules (STRICT)
- NEVER use HTML comments `<!-- ... -->` in Telegram messages, templates, or f-strings!
  Telegram Bot API rejects them with:
  `Bad Request: can't parse entities: Unsupported start tag "!--"`
- Allowed Telegram HTML tags ONLY:
  `<b>`, `<i>`, `<u>`, `<s>`, `<a>`, `<code>`, `<pre>`, `<blockquote>`, `<tg-spoiler>`.
- Any other tags (`<div>`, `<p>`, `<span>`, `<br>`, `<!--`) are STRICTLY FORBIDDEN in Telegram payloads.
- Always sanitize dynamic or user-generated text using `safe_html_format()` or `html.escape()`.
